{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xrz26bLzhdrQBdBYG8Y8AQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 phase-gated-compound-sparse 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (131 个)\\n\\n- **mvp_v4_legacy_s025**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_v4_random_r2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_v4_legacy_s01**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_v4_legacy_s03**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_v4_legacy_s02**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_v4c_r2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_v4b_r2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_v4a_r2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v4-random**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v4c**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v4b**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v4**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_ii_profiling_v2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_interaction_index_profiling**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| gpqa_ds_importance_s015 | Cross-task generalization: compound sparsity severity monotonically increases on GPQA Diamond (non-math reasoning) using quantile 3-segment phase decomposition (primary method). DS-R1 importance s015 as first condition. | — | — | — |\\n| c8_llama_gpu0_s025 | Pre-emptive run of LLaMA importance s025 on GPU 0 to accelerate c8_llama_n250_fixed (4-round serial → 3-round by pre-completing round 2 condition) | — | — | — |\\n| c8_llama_n250_fixed | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **c10_lang_s020_s025** (success): —\\n- **c4_think_validation_math500** (success): —\\n  [c4_think_validation_math500](/api/workspace-files/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/c4_think_validation_math500/data/c4_think_validation_math500.txt)\\n- **acc_qw_s025_b1_8k** (negative): 重跑 QW importance_s025 batch1 (problems 1-50) with max_new_tokens=8192，修复原 batch1 使用 2048 的 token 预算不匹配问题。\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 64