{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016AZSza7oNkWgqELP8opa7h","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tround: 5\n3\toverall_score: borderline accept\n4\ttimestamp: 2026-05-15T11:06:54.694367+00:00\n5\treviewer_ids: [1, 2]\n6\tcross_response_reviewer_ids: [1, 2]\n7\tforce_resubmit: False\n8\t---\n9\t\n10\t# 圆桌审稿报告 — Round 5（继续审稿）\n11\t\n12\t**论文**: Phase-Modulated Compound Sparsity: Strategy-Dependent Severity Gradients in Mathematical Reasoning Models\n13\t**Venue**: EMNLP 2026 ARR (Main Conference)\n14\t**截止日期**: 2026-06-15\n15\t**Reviewer 编排**: R1（方法严谨性）+ R2（新颖性/完整性）\n16\t**轮次**: Round 5（修订评估 — 基于 Round 1 审稿意见的修改审查）\n17\t**上轮评分**: 2.5/5 (Weak Reject) → **本轮评分**: 3.5/5 (Borderline Accept)\n18\t\n19\t---\n20\t\n21\t## Summary\n22\t\n23\t论文经过实质性修订：样本量从 n=50 扩展到 n=500（全部 MATH-500），所有 40+ placeholders 已填充，cross-architecture claim 从 \"replicates across three models spanning two architectures\" 降级为 \"exploratory evidence\"，标题限定为 \"Mathematical Reasoning Models\"，机制分析明确标注为 correlational。新增三项 robustness analyses（BH-FDR、min_phase_length sensitivity、segmentation granularity）。统计基础从 borderline adequate 提升到 strong：所有主条件 p < 10^-69 (DS) / 10^-14 (QW)，JT test 补充了 Spearman 的 n=4 局限性。\n24\t\n25\tRound 1 的 5 个 critical issues 全部得到实质性回应。两位 Reviewer 独立将评分从 2.5 上调至 3.5。\n26\t\n27\t---\n28\t\n29\t## Round 1 Issue Resolution Status\n30\t\n31\t### Critical Issues (5/5 Resolved)\n32\t\n33\t| Issue | Round 1 Severity | Round 5 Status | 评估 |\n34\t|-------|-----------------|----------------|------|\n35\t| R1-N1: 40+ placeholders | Critical | **RESOLVED** | 全部填充，grep 确认零残留 |\n36\t| R1-N4: Cross-arch overclaim | Critical | **RESOLVED** | §5.5 \"Exploratory\"，Abstract \"preliminary\"，Contribution \"exploratory evidence\" |\n37\t| R1-N3: Single benchmark | Critical | **RESOLVED** | Title → \"Mathematical Reasoning Models\"；Limitations 有 MATH-500 justification |\n38\t| R1-N2: Sample size / power | Critical | **RESOLVED** | n=500，exclusion criteria (DS 4, QW 25) stated，CI width shrinkage 2.5-5.9× |\n39\t| R1-N5: Mechanism correlational | Critical | **RESOLVED** | §6 split: §6.1 discrimination collapse (robust) + §6.2 entropy (model-dependent)；\"correlational\" explicit |\n40\t\n41\t### Warning Issues (10/11 Resolved or Partially Resolved)\n42\t\n43\t| Issue | Round 5 Status | 评估 |\n44\t|-------|----------------|------|\n45\t| R2-N3: HIES differentiation | **RESOLVED** | §6.1 + Related Work 有 explicit comparison |\n46\t| R1-W1: Phase segmentation | **PARTIAL** | Sensitivity analysis 完备（mpl, quartile, quintile），但 \"following ThinKV\" 措辞仍在 background.tex:33 |\n47\t| R1-W2: Symmetric sparsity | **RESOLVED** | Limitations 有专门段落 |\n48\t| R1-W3: G instability | **RESOLVED** | Δ primary，G auxiliary with bootstrap CIs |\n49\t| R1-W4: Bonferroni scope | **RESOLVED** | k=4 justified，BH-FDR 44-test appendix |\n50\t| R1-W5: Spearman overinterpret | **RESOLVED** | n=4 caveat + one-tailed + JT test (z=6.2-33.7) |\n51\t| R1-W6: Exclusion criteria | **RESOLVED** | §4 complete |\n52\t| R2-W3: Missing refs | **RESOLVED** | RLKV/LongFlow/PM-KVQ all added |\n53\t| R2-W5: Abstract dense | **RESOLVED** | Rewritten, ~10 lines, structured |\n54\t| REV-ADD-2: Random threshold | **RESOLVED** | Integrated in §5.1 + cross-model |\n55\t| REV-ADD-3: Qwen mid-phase | **RESOLVED** | Reported with autocorrelation explanation |\n56\t\n57\t### Info Issues (4/4 Resolved)\n58\t\n59\tR2-Minor-2 (REVIEWER-ATTACK comments), R2-Minor-6 (s=0.35), R1-Minor-code (reproducibility) — all resolved. R2-Minor-1 (bib) partially resolved (h2o fixed, but LongFlow \"Withdrawn\" note introduced).\n60\t\n61\t---\n62\t\n63\t## Strengths（修订后增强）\n64\t\n65\t**S1** [retained, strengthened] **研究问题有价值且定义清晰**。Phase-strategy interaction 的 characterization 对 efficient inference 部署有直接意义。n=500 的统计基础使 claim 可信。\n66\t\n67\t**S2** [retained, strengthened] **统计方法论从 adequate 提升到 exemplary**。新增 BH-FDR (44 tests)、JT dose-response test、mpl sensitivity (3 settings × 16 conditions)、segmentation robustness (tercile/quartile/quintile)。Bootstrap B=10,000, seed=42, Bonferroni k=4 per family — 统计报告质量在 ML 论文中属顶尖。\n68\t\n69\t**S3** [retained] **Random eviction falsification control 设计巧妙**。随机蒸发的阈值故事（s≤0.20 non-significant, s≥0.25 significant but 3-39× weaker）现已完整呈现，强化了 strategy-specificity claim。\n70\t\n71\t**S4** [retained] **Crossover 发现有 deployment insight**。Strategy ranking reversal 对 uniform budget 设计直接有启示。\n72\t\n73\t**S5** [new] **Honest claim scoping**。修订版在 title、abstract、contributions 中系统性地降级了 overclaimed 内容。LLaMA \"exploratory\"、mechanism \"correlational\"、scope \"mathematical reasoning\" — 这是修订中最难做到的部分，作者做到了。\n74\t\n75\t**S6** [new] **Robustness appendix 显著提升可信度**。Table 5 (BH-FDR)、Table 6 (mpl sensitivity, 16 conditions × 3 settings)、Table 7 (segmentation, 4 sparsity × 3 schemes) — 远超多数 EMNLP submission。\n76\t\n77\t**S7** [new] **Qwen mid-phase null rate 分析透彻**。lag-1 autocorrelation explanation (r=0.718 vs 0.894, d=-1.68) 不仅报告问题还解释了 root cause，展示了作者对数据的深度理解。\n78\t\n79\t---\n80\t\n81\t## Weaknesses（修订后残留 + 新发现）\n82\t\n83\t### Should-Fix（影响评分但不阻碍接收）\n84\t\n85\t**SF1** [warning, R1] **n=50 / n=500 数据混合可能误导读者**\n86\t- Table 2（per-phase II breakdown, main body §5.2）使用 n=50 profiling subset 数据\n87\t- Table 1 (§5.1) 和 Table 3 (§5.6) 使用 n=496 / n=475 数据\n88\t- Caption 标注了 \"n=50 profiling subset\" 并引用 Table 1 确认，但同一 Results section 混合两个 sample size 的数据易造成混淆\n89\t- crossover 分析 (§5.3 + Appendix A) 同样使用 n=50 数据（exp_id: bf16_importance_s025, bf16_ds_rand_s025）\n90\t- **建议**：将 Table 2 移至 Appendix 或在 §5.2 添加一段话明确说明 n=50 profiling 与 n=500 confirmation 的关系\n91\t\n92\t**SF2** [warning, R1] **Crossover 未在 n=500 验证**\n93\t- §5.3 的策略排名反转（5.3× reversal at s=0.25）基于 n=50 per-phase II 值\n94\t- 全文 crossover 引用的 II 数值（0.032 vs 0.818, 7.196 vs 1.363）均来自 profiling subset\n95\t- Discussion §7 引用相同 crossover 数值作为 \"quantitative surprise\" 论据\n96\t- 如果 n=500 per-phase II 值不同，crossover magnitude 可能改变\n97\t- **建议**：在 n=500 数据上验证 crossover；或在 §5.3 标注 \"profiling subset\" 并 caveat\n98\t\n99\t**SF3** [warning, R1-W1 residual] **\"following ThinKV\" 措辞仍未修正**\n100\t- background.tex:33: \"following ThinKV [thinkv-iclr2026]\"\n101\t- ThinKV 使用 explicit `<think>` token delimiters 分割 reasoning/non-reasoning 阶段\n102\t- 本文使用 attention sparsity quantile terciles — 方法论完全不同\n103\t- Round 1 已明确提出需修正；Round 5 sensitivity analysis 已添加但措辞未改\n104\t- **建议**：改为 \"inspired by the phase distinction in ThinKV\" 或直接删除 ThinKV 引用\n105\t\n106\t### Minor（不影响接收决定）\n107\t\n108\t**M1** [info, R2] **LongFlow bib \"Withdrawn from ICLR 2026\" 注释**\n109\t- 新增引用 LongFlow 的 bib entry 包含 withdrawn 标注\n110\t- 引用被撤回论文可能被审稿人视为 literature curation 不够严谨\n111\t- **建议**：确认 LongFlow 实际状态；如确实 withdrawn，移除引用或使用 arXiv preprint 形式\n112\t\n113\t**M2** [info, R2] **\\\\placeholder 命令定义残留**\n114\t- main.tex:21 仍有 `\\newcommand{\\placeholder}[1]{\\textcolor{red}{[#1]}}`\n115\t- 虽未使用（grep 确认无调用），但提交源码时暗示论文曾有 placeholder 结构\n116\t- **建议**：删除该行\n117\t\n118\t---\n119\t\n120\t## Questions for Authors\n121\t\n122\t1. Table 2 的 n=50 per-phase II 数据在 n=500 上是否有变化？特别是 crossover 的 reversal magnitude（3.9×-5.4×）在 n=500 上是否一致？\n123\t2. \"following ThinKV\" 措辞为何未在本轮修改？是否为 oversight？\n124\t3. LongFlow 是否确实从 ICLR 2026 撤稿？如果是，是否有更合适的替代引用？\n125\t4. Oracle pilot experiment 的 gate failure (18% < 30%) 是否有后续实验计划？\n126\t\n127\t---\n128\t\n129\t## Missing References\n130\t\n131\tRound 1 指出的 RLKV、LongFlow、PM-KVQ 均已补充。本轮未发现新的重要遗漏。\n132\t\n133\t---\n134\t\n135\t## External Review (Stanford Agentic Reviewer)\n136\t\n137\t外部审稿：未配置。\n138\t\n139\t---\n140\t\n141\t## Overall Assessment\n142\t\n143\t**评分: 3.5/5 (Borderline Accept)**\n144\t**置信度: 4/5**\n145\t\n146\t**修订质量评估**: 本轮修订是高质量的实质性回应。5/5 critical issues resolved，10/11 warning issues resolved or partially resolved。n=50→n=500 的扩展消除了 power 疑虑，robustness analyses（BH-FDR、mpl sensitivity、segmentation）远超预期。Claim scoping（title、abstract、contributions）诚实且系统。\n147\t\n148\t**残留问题严重性**: 所有残留问题均为 warning 或 info 级别：\n149\t- SF1-SF2 (n=50/n=500 混合 + crossover 未验证): 最重要的残留问题，但不改变核心 conclusion——n=500 data 已独立确认 monotonic severity gradient\n150\t- SF3 (\"following ThinKV\"): 措辞修正，5 分钟工作量\n151\t- M1-M2: 纯 cosmetic\n152\t\n153\t**接收障碍分析**:\n154\t- **支持接收**: 研究问题有价值；n=500 统计基础强；falsification control 设计优秀；claim scoping 诚实；robustness 超越多数 EMNLP submissions\n155\t- **反对接收**: 仍是 single-benchmark (MATH-500) characterization study；mechanism 为 correlational only；crossover claim 基于 n=50 子集未在 n=500 验证\n156\t- **关键判断**: 对于以 empirical characterization 为核心贡献的论文，当前 evidence quality 达到了 EMNLP main 的门槛，但不具备显著 margin。如果 SF1-SF2 得到解决（crossover 在 n=500 上验证），评分可上调至 4/5。\n157\t\n158\t**建议**:\n159\t- 如果能在投稿前完成 crossover n=500 验证、修正 \"following ThinKV\" 措辞、清理 LongFlow bib 和 \\placeholder 残留：推荐投稿 EMNLP main\n160\t- 如果时间不允许验证 crossover：仍可投稿，但应在 §5.3 添加 \"profiling subset\" caveat，crossover 可能被 reviewer 追问\n161\t\n162\t---\n163\t\n164\t## Detailed Comments\n165\t\n166\t### Per-Section Notes\n167\t\n168\t**Abstract**: 修订后结构清晰，统计数字适量。\"preliminary cross-architecture evidence\" 措辞恰当。唯一微瑕：最后一句 \"motivate phase-aware compression budgets\" 略 overclaim（pilot experiment gate failed at 18%）。\n169\t\n170\t**§1 Introduction**: Contribution scoping 准确。\"3-39× larger\" 比 Round 1 的 \"absent under random\" 更精确，正确反映了 threshold story。Contribution 3 \"propose...as a mechanistic explanation\" 恰当。\n171\t\n172\t**§2 Related Work**: HIES comparison 充分。PM-KVQ temporal dimension link 是好的补充。LongFlow withdrawn status 需确认。整体 coverage 完整。\n173\t\n174\t**§3 Background**: G 的 auxiliary 定位明确。\"following ThinKV\" 需改为 \"inspired by\" 或删除。公式定义清晰。\n175\t\n176\t**§4 Methodology**: n=500 full dataset, exclusion criteria, CI width shrinkage, Bonferroni k=4 family justification, JT test — 统计报告质量优秀。Qwen mid-phase null 的 autocorrelation explanation 是亮点。\n177\t\n178\t**§5 Results**: Table 1 (n=496) 可信且 powerful。Table 2 (n=50) 的 provenance 需更突出标注。§5.3 crossover 需 n=500 验证或 caveat。§5.4 cross-model 完整。§5.5 LLaMA exploratory 措辞恰当。§5.6 statistical validation 强。\n179\t\n180\t**§6 Analysis**: §6.1 discrimination collapse 的 HIES comparison 和 random-eviction counterfactual 构成 reasonable correlational case。§6.2 entropy redistribution 诚实标注 model-dependent。\"correlational; causal validation...important direction for future work\" — 恰当。\n181\t\n182\t**§7 Discussion**: Oracle pilot gate failure (18% < 30%) 诚实报告是加分项。Architecture-dependent magnitude 讨论平衡。Crossover 数值来自 n=50（与 SF2 同一问题）。\n183\t\n184\t**Limitations**: 全面。Symmetric sparsity、mechanism correlational、sparsity range — 覆盖了主要方向。MATH-500 justification 有说服力。\n185\t\n186\t**Appendix**: BH-FDR (44 tests) + mpl sensitivity (48 cells) + segmentation robustness (12 cells) — 三项 robustness 构成强有力的 supplementary evidence。Crossover appendix 和 permutation test 仍使用 n=50 数据（与主文一致但同样是潜在问题）。\n187\t\n188\t**References**: 32 篇引用，新增 RLKV/LongFlow/PM-KVQ。LongFlow withdrawn status 需处理。其余引用无问题。\n189\t\n190\t### Round 1 → Round 5 Score Justification\n191\t\n192\t| 维度 | Round 1 | Round 5 | 变化原因 |\n193\t|------|---------|---------|----------|\n194\t| 数据完整性 | 1/5 (40+ placeholders) | 5/5 | 全部填充 |\n195\t| 统计严谨性 | 3/5 (n=50, no power) | 5/5 | n=500, BH-FDR, JT, mpl, segmentation |\n196\t| Claim scoping | 2/5 (overclaim) | 4/5 | Title/Abstract/Contribution 系统降级 |\n197\t| 机制分析 | 2/5 (causal language) | 4/5 | correlational explicit, split robust/model-dependent |\n198\t| 写作质量 | 3/5 | 4/5 | Abstract 精简, exclusion stated, HIES compared |\n199\t| 整体 | 2.5/5 | 3.5/5 | Substantial improvement |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NH1j4MdiikGSySZVjUDam8","session_id":"813b3e7b-de85-4f91-a594-365a71c45c1e","uuid":"cdeef113-251b-4f1c-95d9-f09717094af2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:10:04.694Z"}
